{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_12_level_main_12-08_beg",
  "groupId": "main_12",
  "stageId": "main_12-08",
  "title": "热血年华",
  "storyCode": "12-9",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_12-08_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "58853350c5125d3e931ac9b91c45f84b5ddbbb7581925627565bb15f1e388641",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "这间房间......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "text": "瞧瞧，达格达，这就是我们以前的家！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "达格达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "text": "哦哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "达格达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "text": "在这里的日子，一定相当不错！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "text": "那是当然！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "不过汉娜从来不打扫卫生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "text": "喂，维娜！我已经承认过很多遍错误了好吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝尔德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "你们走后，我偶尔会过来一下，收拾收拾，应该和几年前没什么不同吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "text": "老子的收藏全都在！贝尔德，果然还是你靠谱啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝尔德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "唉，谁让我是那个被留下来看家的可怜人呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "text": "别跟我来这套，贝尔德，当初是你自己要留下来的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "text": "你说你睡觉认床，离开诺伯特区立马失眠！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝尔德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "也许当时我应该努力克服一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "text": "拉倒吧！你什么人我还不知道？你要是睡不着，大家就都别想安生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "text": "我可不想再在困得要死的时候被你拉着聊天了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝尔德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "......哈哈，这些日子，我倒是在哪都睡得着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "怎么，太累了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝尔德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "也许吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝尔德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "我只是发现......睡觉是放空大脑的最好方法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "......等到罗德岛的任务结束，贝尔德，我会带你们离开这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "带你们所有人一起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "text": "来来来，让我们开瓶酒庆祝一下这个时隔几年的重逢吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "text": "虽然都是些便宜货，但放了那么久，说不定就变好喝了呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "text": "摩根，给贝尔德看看你写的那些书！说说咱们一路的冒险！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "text": "嘿，贝尔德，你可是错过了成为国王历险记里一员的机会——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "text": "......摩根？你怎么了？你好像一直脸色都不是很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "text": "我们可是好不容易回家了！你应该高兴一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "text": "我在想......我踩到的那只......手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "text": "可能只是个意外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "text": "那只手上有一枚扳指，我总觉得我在哪里见过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "text": "我应当记得......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "text": "可就是怎么都想不起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "text": "我......贝尔德，诺伯特区这些天发生了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝尔德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "......没什么，摩根，或许真的只是场意外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝尔德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "大家都在努力地活下去，仅此而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝尔德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "这些都过去了，你们回来了，我们很快就会离开这里，这就够了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "text": "诺伯特区，这里是我们的家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "text": "我想过我们回来时候的样子，我还以为第一夜我们会去那家台球厅玩个通宵，再去隔壁那家酒吧喝个天昏地暗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "text": "或者找录像厅的麦克拉伦包场，看十场连映的冒险电影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "text": "我看到了，但我没敢仔细看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "text": "那些碎掉的玻璃和玻璃上干涸的血，那些倒在里面的......黑影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝尔德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "你应该像我一样，好好睡一觉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝尔德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "这一路过来，你们都太累了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "text": "维娜，你现在有那把国剑了，你会是那个英雄，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "text": "你会救下诺伯特区的，我们会救下诺伯特区的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "text": "这些都只是暂时的艰难罢了，对吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "......当然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "我们会夺回过去的生活的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝尔德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "或许......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝尔德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "不，已经很晚了，休息吧，伙计们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝尔德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "明天还有一大堆事情要忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "贝尔德说的对，摩根，我们都需要......好好休息一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "推进之王蜷缩在沙发上，她曾经在这里度过无数个夜晚，这里的每一寸触感她仍然熟悉。\n她还记得很多年前，她们在旧货市场上淘到了这张老沙发，四个人花了吃奶的力气才把这破东西搬上拳馆的二楼。\n在那时，这座沙发对于她还称得上是宽广，很快，她就得把脚翘在扶手上才能在这里容身。\n在黑暗中，推进之王的手抚过沙发的每一寸。\n这里是汉娜练习耍她那把小刀时留下的划痕，她当时为此内疚了三天。\n摩根曾把一大瓶饮料洒在这里，她买了罐劣质清洁剂来处理污渍，最后越弄越糟，至今都留有大片滑腻的痕迹。\n贝尔德把熨斗放在沙发上忘了关，差点烧着了整个房间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她曾以为这样的日子永远不会变。\n她曾坚信这样的日子永远不会变。\n这里是她们的格拉斯哥帮，她们的街区，她们成长的地方，她们的家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "是的，她回来了。\n可她的心中，却没有一丝欣喜。\n她又想起了摩根的那本“回忆录”，《伟大的维娜陛下和她伟大的朋友们》。\n推进之王轻轻触碰着放在身边的诸王之息。\n那把剑依然冰冷如初。\n领袖。英雄。国王。\n推进之王维娜。\n亚历山德莉娜·维娜·维多利亚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝尔德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "怎么了，维娜？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "......这件衣服太重了，睡觉时压得我喘不过气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "我想找几件更舒服的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝尔德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "在那个抽屉里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "text": "呼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝尔德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "看来你这些年没长个，嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "text": "......我们都多大了，早过了长个子的年纪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝尔德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "成长这东西可说不准，我记得我们第一次遇见的时候，你明明才那么高......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "text": "行了行了，又是你那套感叹时间流逝的老话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝尔德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "这些老话，我可是很多年没有可以讲的对象了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "text": "......抱歉，贝尔德。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝尔德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "回来就好，维娜陛下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "text": "......别这么叫我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝尔德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝尔德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "那就还是叫你，推进之王。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "text": "怎么了，埃芒加德女士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "text": "别叫我女士，我还没那么老。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "text": "抱歉，埃芒加德......小姐？我搞不太清你们巫妖的年纪......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "text": "唉，算了，就叫我埃芒加德女士吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "text": "这艘高速军舰毁得还真彻底，啧，血魔的人还又把这里洗了一遍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "text": "曼弗雷德将军说，这会是萨卡兹胜利的开始。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "text": "哼，萨卡兹的胜利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "text": "唉，那位凯尔希女士一再警告我，这样的未来无法给我们带来任何东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "text": "可我还是不明白，我的老师为什么会有一位菲林老朋友？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_869_1",
      "text": "走吧，我讨厌这里的味道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "text": "请跟我来，特蕾西娅殿下在等您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "text": "博士，早安。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "text": "我们需要对接下来的行动......做出安排了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "text": "萨卡兹把这些平民当做他们不被炮火直接袭击的保险，但无论是军事委员会还是大公爵，我们都不能真的相信他们的仁慈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "text": "就算我们无视这些正发生在他们之间的博弈，现在封锁区的糟糕状况，我们也都看在眼里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝尔德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "你们已经看到了如今诺伯特区的混乱情况，要改变现状并不容易。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝尔德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_863_1",
      "text": "你们带来的那些药物......我清点过数量，恐怕只是杯水车薪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "text": "是的，仅仅凭借我们，能做到的事情实在有限，但这不是我们裹足不前的理由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "text": "针对飞空艇的调查和对地块平民的撤离计划必须同时展开，我们不能忽视任何一边。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "text": "那个......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "text": "怎么了，戴菲恩小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "text": "你们很厉害，对吧？你们能穿过萨卡兹的封锁来到这里，你们应该同样能轻松抽身而出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "text": "我可以骄傲地说，现在聚集在这里的都是罗德岛了不起的干员，但是很抱歉，戴菲恩小姐，我们恐怕没有你想象的那么强大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "text": "相比于那些战争背后的操纵者，我们甚至称得上十足弱小。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "text": "所以......你们是接受了帮助才能进来这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "text": "按那位先生一直强调的说法，恐怕该说成是“交易”，而且很不光彩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "text": "你是......萨卡兹？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "text": "某位大公爵居然与另一批萨卡兹达成了合作......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "text": "哼，看来你琢磨的东西很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "text": "......不，我只是经常读报罢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "text": "真是个好习惯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "text": "你们正在策划一场撤离行动，是吗？你们背后的那位大人物承诺了帮忙？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "text": "很遗憾，没有，她看起来并不在乎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "text": "但是你们显然很在乎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "text": "哈，这些人可是罗德岛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "text": "我对此不发表意见，我更关心我们能不能活着离开这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "text": "我有一个提议，罗德岛的各位，这可能有点冒险......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "text": "萨卡兹封锁了所有诺伯特区向外传递消息的渠道，我能猜到他们对外的说辞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "text": "我相信，无论是哪个大公爵，都很清楚那不过是“说辞”而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "text": "但他们不会主动戳破，不如说，大公爵和卡兹戴尔军事委员会反倒在这一点上达成了默契。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "text": "萨卡兹把这地块上的人当盾牌，大公爵们何尝不是？我猜，要是这里的人被萨卡兹杀了个一干二净，有几位大公爵反倒会长舒一口气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "text": "在一场战争中，某些人只会把道德视作负担。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "text": "是的，您说的没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "text": "那我们......就打破这种默契。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "text": "我们必须推一把大公爵们，逼迫他们更果断地行动起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_866_1",
      "text": "......在我们真的全都死在这里之前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_647_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "变形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "text": "好几天了，戈尔丁，你总是一言不发。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "变形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "text": "就我们所知，你不是个如此沉默的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_647_1",
      "text": "伦蒂尼姆市民自救军的情况怎么样了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "变形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "text": "他们离开了这座城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_647_1",
      "text": "还剩下多少人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "变形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "text": "也许不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_647_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "变形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "text": "好吧，又是沉默。沉默能给你带来安宁吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_647_1",
      "text": "我只是在......回忆他们，回忆他们每一个人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "变形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "text": "好啦，好啦，戈尔丁，你并不天然地属于他们，你自然也可以忘却这一种虚无的归属。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "变形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "text": "并不是你亲手杀了他们，大部分人本就会死在这场战争里。你们甚至为此发明了一个词，“牺牲”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "变形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "text": "那些名字，那些藏匿于名字之后的人，大部分你甚至都从未见过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "变形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "text": "成为一个集体的一员能让你感到快乐和骄傲吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "变形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "text": "很遗憾，如你所见，我们只能归属于我们自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_647_1",
      "text": "不，我曾以为是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_647_1",
      "text": "在一开始，我以为我为之奋斗的是我们共同的梦想，是自救军的事业。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_647_1",
      "text": "这几天我发现，或许并非如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_647_1",
      "text": "莱托说的话是对的，我们都是一类人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_647_1",
      "text": "我曾说他悲观......我又何尝不是呢。不管我自己承不承认......我都是一个容易失望的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_647_1",
      "text": "自救军的成员们或许是怀着纯洁的理念而奋斗的人，但是自救军本身不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_647_1",
      "text": "无论是克洛维希娅还是阿勒黛......我尊重她们的为人，可是她们的目的绝不仅仅像是嘴上说的那样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_647_1",
      "text": "我在很长一段时间里，假装自己对这些毫无察觉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "变形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "text": "你现在为此感到幻灭了。你终于察觉到你的事业从一开始就并非纯洁无瑕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "变形者集群",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "text": "你觉得你的努力都是徒劳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_647_1",
      "text": "怎么会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_647_1",
      "text": "所以，我不去想什么事业，我只是在想那些人。那一张张的面孔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_647_1",
      "text": "海蒂、费斯特、洛洛、老比尔、亚当斯、小乔治......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_647_1",
      "text": "我没有资格，也没有权利自称我该为伦蒂尼姆市民自救军悔罪。我不需属于那些虚幻的集体。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_647_1",
      "text": "但我需要......在心中面对他们每一个人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
